<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Feral Druid Tank Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Feral Druid Tank Phase 3</h3>The 25-man Heroic version (Item Level 258) of the Tier 9 helm is the BiS option for both factions in Phase 3 of WotLK, but will be extremely contested since a maximum of four 258 Tier tokens can drop each week from completing <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="achievement" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/achievement=3818/a-tribute-to-mad-skill-25-player">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">A Tribute to Mad Skill (25 player)</span></a>. As mentioned in the <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> section above, the best alternative is the 245 Item Level version of the same helm, which should be more practical to obtain since <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> drops in both the 10- and 25-man versions of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>. Alternatively, if you plan on PvPing competitively in Arena Season 7, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41679/relentless-gladiators-dragonhide-helm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_126.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relentless Gladiator's Dragonhide Helm</span></a> is also an excellent alternative for survival setups.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67839/mind-amplification-dish">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mind Amplification Dish</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>.<br/>If you are not an Engineer, then the best alternative helm enchant is <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44150/arcanum-of-the-stalwart-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_swordandboard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Stalwart Protector</span></a> from Revered <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1106/argent-crusade">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Argent Crusade</span></a> reputation. For main tanking <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34564/anubarak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Anub'arak</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44138/arcanum-of-toxic-warding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_brewpoison.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Toxic Warding</span></a> is an extremely efficient Nature Resistance swap to limit boss healing from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=66118/leeching-swarm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_insectswarm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leeching Swarm</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
