<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Feral Druid Tank Phase 3</h3>The 258 Item Level Tier 9 shoulders are overall the best Phase 3 tanking option due to their efficient stat distribution. However, when itemizing for maximum survival chance against hard hitting mobs like <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34607/nerubian-burrower">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Nerubian Burrower</span></a> adds or <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=32871/algalon-the-observer">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Algalon the Observer</span></a>, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45245/shoulderpads-of-the-intruder">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_51.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shoulderpads of the Intruder</span></a> from Phase 2 can be swapped in to boost your EHP further.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44957/greater-inscription-of-the-gladiator">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of the Gladiator</span></a>
<br/>For main tanking <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34564/anubarak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Anub'arak</span></a>, <a class="q2 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=29187/inscription-of-endurance">
