<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Feral Druid Tank Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45611/solar-bindings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solar Bindings</span></a> off <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=32871/algalon-the-observer">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Algalon the Observer</span></a> (25) will continue to provide the best overall tanking value among the Phase 3 bracer options for most encounters and tanking roles. However, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47474/armbands-of-dark-determination">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_36a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armbands of Dark Determination</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47155/bracers-of-dark-determination">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_23b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Dark Determination</span></a> are the best pure survival option and can be swapped in as needed for the hardest hitting mobs in the tier.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57690/fur-lining-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Stamina</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57699/fur-lining-nature-resist">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Nature Resist</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>.<br/>If you are not a Leatherworker, then the best alternative bracer enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62256/enchant-bracers-major-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracers - Major Stamina</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
